M1'S DEPLOYMENT CONDITION ON THE FULL PLANE GRID FOR THE TWO LID OPTIONS (plane_grid.py, stream l3plane, MESHSAT-1357).
PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing built, ordered or measured. Every figure is MODELED on the reference day of SC-37 (September
mean day at Leiden, PVGIS DRcalc 2005 to 2020, each plane its own day); every condition is INFERRED from the grid. AI
arithmetic, not a qualified review. Model: reconcile_lid_panel.py's run() over a1elec's energy_two_pack.py (pinned),
400 Wp (2S2P Renogy RNG-100DB-H), 200 W stage, entry E2's front end, base +20 C, lid at 13.23 C (the September mean
day's minimum air), both start hours, 42.8 W, aged 80 percent; U3 0.979, U3B at code 62 (7.936 A) and 0.972 carried.
Ratios per plane from energy_runs.py (imported, pinned): B typical, C adverse; PVGIS's 0.9417 (40/0) kept for every plane.

0. REPRODUCTION OF THE COMMITTED OUTPUTS
   0a. v2/docs/records/a1int/reconcile_lid_panel.out: 8 of 8 rows (4S14P and 4S15P; B, C; U3 6.1 and 6.0 A) reproduced byte for byte through the plane
       machinery on the 40/0 anchor (energy_runs.py's file scaled by 1.007820) with that output's own ratios
   0b. v2/docs/records/a1solar/energy_runs.out section 6: 50 of 50 plane rows (the 4S12P lid, entry E2) reproduced byte for byte
   0c. v2/docs/records/s119/reconcile_s119.out section 7: 13 of 13 plane rows (both lid options, U3B hour by hour) reproduced byte for byte
   The grid below therefore runs the committed model; only the plane's day and its two ratios change from row to row.

   The cases (each both starts, lid at 13.23 C; 'both' = the lowest store of the two packs together, Wh):
     P    U3 6.1 A (minimum), U3B carried 0.972
     I    U3 6.0 A (bracket), U3B carried
     H    U3 6.1 A, U3B hour by hour (TI curve)
     V20  U3 6.1 A at the bus's nominal 20.00 V (122.0 W)
     V19  U3 6.1 A at the DC band's low end 19.08 V (116.4 W)
   V20 and V19 are a SENSITIVITY this stream adds (INFERRED): the model turns U3's current limit into power at its
   V_BUS20 of 20.7 V; v2/docs/records/s120/vbus20_bound.out section 2 prints the bus's nominal regulation 20.000 V and DC band 19.080 to 20.960 V.
   The case passes 5.8937 A and 5.6226 A at 20.7 V, the same power. The model and its committed outputs are not changed.

